WEBVTT

00:11:58.810 --> 00:12:01.140
This is also known as a moral hazard.

00:12:02.013 --> 00:12:03.894
But, like most medicines,

00:12:03.918 --> 00:12:07.175
interventions are more dangerous
the more that you do,

00:12:07.199 --> 00:12:09.692
so research actually
tends to draw out the fact

00:12:09.716 --> 00:12:12.786
that we absolutely,
positively cannot continue

00:12:12.810 --> 00:12:15.631
to fill up the atmosphere
with greenhouse gases,

00:12:15.655 --> 00:12:18.132
that these kinds of alternatives are risky

00:12:18.156 --> 00:12:20.527
and if we were to use them,

00:12:20.551 --> 00:12:22.926
we would need to use
as little as possible.

00:12:24.746 --> 00:12:26.677
But even so,

00:12:26.701 --> 00:12:29.405
could we ever learn enough
about these interventions

00:12:29.429 --> 00:12:31.005
to manage the risk?